{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hayo the Fox and the Little Emporium</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/extras/Illust_Prologue_4.png?t=1745994843\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The owner has gone treasure hunting, leaving Hayo the fox behind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can Hayo successfully run the emporium alone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If an item related to a customer is placed nearby, you can earn extra gold and trigger various effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Get Ready to Open</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In your small 5x4 emporium (20 tiles), remove unnecessary items and arrange everything carefully so that customers and items are placed well!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Open the Emporium</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once the business starts, items will be displayed and customers will enter the emporium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You never know where they'll appear...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make sure they can find the items they want!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make Your Best Choice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After closing, you'll meet new customers and discover new items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make strategic choices to create your very own unique emporium!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Time to Settle Up</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time to settle accounts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Check if you've achieved your profit goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If not... your emporium will go bankrupt!</p></li></ul>","ba