ppear...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make sure they can find the items they want!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make Your Best Choice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After closing, you'll meet new customers and discover new items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make strategic choices to create your very own unique emporium!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Time to Settle Up</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time to settle accounts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Check if you've achieved your profit goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If not... your emporium will go bankrupt!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Catdoors"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589350/c11bd312d3799231826b958347cd9ed39383c900/header.jpg?t=1745994843","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257133210,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133210/movie480.mp4?t=1745994841","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133210/movie_max.mp4?t=1745994841"},"name":"Hayo_pv","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257133210/9e6dac6c86e3e1d1f83e5615e33038f4ecec13d6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745994841","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133210/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745994841","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133210/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745994841"}}],"name":"Hayo and the Emporium","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core 2.6 ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</str